  "body": "## What type of PR is this?\n\n- [ ] API-change\n- [ ] BUG\n- [ ] Improvement\n- [ ] Documentation\n- [x] Feature\n- [ ] Test and CI\n- [ ] Code Refactoring\n\n## Which issue(s) this PR fixes:\n\nissue #24184\n\n## What this PR does / why we need it:\n\nBackports 8 MySQL type compatibility features from `main` to `3.0-dev`:\n\n1. **YEAR type** (`cdd430d0d5`) — `YEAR` column type, storage, wire protocol, cast, aggregate\n2. **SET type** (`7b53ff1215`) — `SET` column type, storage, wire protocol, cast, planner\n3. **Decimal scientific notation** (`c01918106b`) — parse `1e2`, `1.5e-3` as DECIMAL literals\n4. **TEXT→CHAR/VARCHAR cast** (`54d9635908`) — allow casting TEXT to CHAR/VARCHAR\n5. **Decimal comparison precision** (`37a2eda6a6`) — fix comparison scale alignment and `DIV` range validation\n6. **DECIMAL(M,D) up to 65 digits / Decimal256** (`688b68b618`) — support `DECIMAL(65,30)` via 256-bit decimal type\n7. **Float/exp() overflow alignment** (`5a25a14008`) — align overflow behavior with MySQL for `EXP()` and arithmetic\n8. **Geometry/spatial typing** (`d23b1258e5`) — `GEOMETRY`/`POINT`/etc. column types, `SRID` attribute, `ST_*` spatial functions, spatial index support\n\n### Key 3.0-dev adaptation changes\n- Removed `GeneratedCol` and `attr_has_generated` references (main-only fields not present in 3.0-dev catalog)\n- Replaced `catalog.Async` constant with string literal `\"async\"` (not backported in 3.0-dev)\n- Added `IsIndexAsync` helper to `catalog` package for async fulltext index detection\n- Fixed `T_decimal256` missing case in `vector.setupFromData` (caused panic on Decimal256 queries)\n- Restored truncating integer division for Decimal64/128 in `decimalIntegerDiv` (regression from Decimal256 backport)\n- Fixed `information_schema.COLUMNS` view to use placeholder for `GENERATION_EXPRESSION` (no generated column support in 3.0-dev)\n- Adapted test API calls for 3.0-dev (`MakeVarcharVector`, `MakeVarlenaVector` signatures differ)\n- Removed main-only test functions (`TestOrd`, `TestBuildWithInsert`, `RewriteCountNotNullColToStarcount`, etc.)\n\n### Verification\n- `make` ✅\n- `make static-check` ✅ (no new errors introduced)\n- Unit tests: `pkg/sql/plan/...`, `pkg/sql/plan/function/...` ✅\n- BVT: `test/distributed/cases/function/func_geometry.test` — 756/756 (100%) ✅",
